---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/skills.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- a skill's hit without using it is ignored
@1000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
   -> event: conn#4: ignored Hit with a skill not in use
-- the wide swing costs 12 mana; its hits do skill damage
@1000 conn#4 sends UseSkill 1 target=Some(1)
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 7=468
@1000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=1 flags=1 amount=58
-- ignored: the same hopper at once, a normal skill number not in use
@1000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
@1000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=2
   -> event: conn#4: ignored Hit with a skill not in use
-- a second hopper; a third is past its two
@1000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=2 skill=1
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=2 flags=1 amount=72
@1000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=3 skill=1
-- the first hopper five more times, 200 ms apart: the fifth hit is its last
@1200 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=1 flags=1 amount=54
@1400 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=1 flags=1 amount=72
@1600 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=1 flags=1 amount=62
@1800 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=1 flags=1 amount=58
@2000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=1 skill=1
-- its cooldown runs for 5 s, which a use too soon hears; its hits stop after 3 s
@2000 conn#4 sends UseSkill 1 target=None
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "The skill is ready again in 4 s."
@5000 conn#4 sends Pong
@5000 conn#4 sends Hit vid=2 skill=1
   -> event: conn#4: ignored Hit with a skill not in use
-- 5 s after its use it can be used again
@6200 conn#4 sends UseSkill 1 target=None
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 7=456
-- the long reach hits one monster
@6200 conn#4 sends UseSkill 2 target=Some(3)
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 7=451
@6200 conn#4 sends Hit vid=3 skill=2
   -> send conn#4 Damage vid=3 flags=1 amount=32
